## CQ-RFX-02 | tooltip colors by role: six tooltips look as before
@group client
@commands Hover each item; screenshot; compare with the before shots (section text)
@pass Copper Ingot Material Information lines dark gray; Precision Sawblade "Unprogrammed" line dark gray; Canned Food "REMOVED ITEM: DO NOT USE" bold red; Dragon Helmet "When worn:" header and "(infinite)" gray, effect names green or red; Echo Pickaxe "On hit, inflicts to target:" gray; Rich Farmland Botany Pots lines gray
@fails A white line: a role key missing from `global.tooltips.col` (Common's `assets/creativecommon/kubejs/_lib/tooltips.js`); a `§` shown literally: `global.tooltips` not defined when the effect lines were built (`armor_effects.js` `textCode`)
